        "output": "Top 5 by mean Q3 2019 tour-group flow: Thailand 1,548,725; Japan 1,247,334; Taiwan 944,784; Vietnam 682,555; Singapore 468,114\nTotal flow: 8,942,938\nOECD share: 35.0%  Top 10 share: 74.1%"
